---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="Terms and Conditions | Shelley Liu Counselling Service"
	description="Website terms and conditions for Shelley Liu Counselling Service, covering acceptable use, enquiries, intellectual property, data protection, and limitation of liability."
>
	<Header />
	
	<main class="py-10 sm:py-16 md:py-24 bg-[#faf9f6]">
		<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			
			<div class="mb-6 sm:mb-10 space-y-3 border-b border-stone-200 pb-6 sm:pb-8">
				<a 
					href="/" 
					class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-900 hover:text-emerald-950 transition-colors group"
				>
					<svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#5ad01f] group-hover:-translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
						<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18" />
					</svg>
					Back to Home
				</a>
				<h1 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl text-stone-900 font-normal tracking-tight">
					Website Terms and Conditions
				</h1>
				<p class="text-xs text-stone-500 font-light">
					Please read these Terms and Conditions carefully before using this website or submitting an enquiry form. By accessing or using this website, you agree to be bound by these terms. If you do not agree to all of these terms, please do not use this website.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="bg-white rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl p-5 sm:p-8 md:p-12 border border-stone-200/80 shadow-2xs space-y-6 sm:space-y-8 text-stone-700 font-light text-base leading-relaxed">
				
				<section class="space-y-2 sm:space-y-3">
					<h2 class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl text-stone-900 font-medium">1. Website for Information Only</h2>
					<p>
						The content provided on this website is for general informational purposes only. It is intended to help you understand the types of counselling services offered and how to get in touch. The information on this website does not constitute medical, psychological, or professional therapeutic advice, and it should not be used as a substitute for a professional assessment, diagnosis, or treatment.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="space-y-2 sm:space-y-3">
					<h2 class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl text-stone-900 font-medium">2. No Therapist-Client Relationship</h2>
					<p>
						Your use of this website, including the submission of an enquiry form, email, or telephone message, does not establish or constitute a therapist-client or contractual relationship. A formal counselling agreement will only be established after a personal consultation, mutual agreement, and the signing of a separate, specific Counselling Contract.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="space-y-2 sm:space-y-3">
					<h2 class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl text-stone-900 font-medium">3. Not a Crisis or Emergency Service</h2>
					<p>
						This website and the enquiry form are not designed, monitored, or intended for crisis or emergency communications. We do not provide an immediate or emergency response service.
					</p>
					<p>
						If you are in distress, experiencing a mental health crisis, or are in immediate danger of harming yourself or others, please contact the emergency services (such as dialing 999 or 111 in the UK), attend your nearest Accident &amp; Emergency (A&amp;E) department, or contact a dedicated helpline such as the Samaritans (116 123).
					</p>
					<p>
						Any links, phone numbers, or references to external crisis services and third-party support organisations are provided solely for your convenience and information. We do not control, monitor, or guarantee these external services. We accept no responsibility or liability for the availability, accuracy, operations, or quality of support provided by any external crisis services, helplines, or third-party websites.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="space-y-2 sm:space-y-3">
					<h2 class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl text-stone-900 font-medium">4. Website Enquiry Form and Acceptable Use</h2>
					<p>
						When you submit an enquiry through our contact form, you agree to provide accurate, truthful, and up-to-date contact information so that we may respond appropriately. You agree to use this website and its forms only for lawful purposes. You must not:
					</p>
					<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-stone-600">
						<li>Use the form to send unsolicited marketing, promotional content, or spam.</li>
						<li>Submit any material that is abusive, defamatory, threatening, offensive, or otherwise unlawful.</li>
						<li>Attempt to disrupt, maliciously exploit, hack, or introduce viruses to the website or its underlying server.</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section class="space-y-2 sm:space-y-3">
					<h2 class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl text-stone-900 font-medium">5. Response Times</h2>
					<p>
						We aim to respond to all valid contact form enquiries within 48 hours of receipt. Please note that this response window applies to standard working days and excludes weekends and public holidays. While we make every effort to meet this timeframe, response times may occasionally vary due to therapist availability or high demand.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="space-y-2 sm:space-y-3">
					<h2 class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl text-stone-900 font-medium">6. Intellectual Property</h2>
					<p>
						All content on this website, including text, graphics, logos, and layout, is owned by or licensed to us and is protected by copyright and intellectual property laws. You may view, download, or print pages for your own personal, non-commercial use only. Any redistribution, reproduction, or commercial exploitation of the content without prior written consent is strictly prohibited.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="space-y-2 sm:space-y-3">
					<h2 class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl text-stone-900 font-medium">7. Data Protection, Privacy, and Cookies</h2>
					<p>
						Any personal information you provide through the website enquiry form will be handled securely in accordance with our <a href="/privacy-policy" class="text-emerald-900 font-medium hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a> and relevant data protection regulations (including the UK GDPR and Data Protection Act 2018). Information submitted is used solely to respond to your inquiry and evaluate suitability for services.
					</p>
					<p>
						This website does not use cookies, tracking pixels, or analytical software to monitor your browsing behavior or store information on your device.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="space-y-2 sm:space-y-3">
					<h2 class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl text-stone-900 font-medium">8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
					<p>
						While we endeavour to ensure that the information on this website is accurate and up to date, we make no guarantees, warranties, or representations regarding its completeness, accuracy, or continuous availability. We are not liable for any loss or damage arising from your use of, or inability to use, this website or the information contained within it.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="space-y-2 sm:space-y-3">
					<h2 class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl text-stone-900 font-medium">9. Governing Law</h2>
					<p>
						These Terms and Conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of England and Wales. Any disputes arising in connection with this website shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of England and Wales.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="space-y-2 sm:space-y-3">
					<h2 class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl text-stone-900 font-medium">10. Changes to These Terms</h2>
					<p>
						We reserve the right to amend these Terms and Conditions at any time without prior notice. Any updates will be posted directly to this page, and your continued use of the website implies acceptance of the revised terms.
					</p>
				</section>

			</div>

			<div class="mt-6 sm:mt-8 text-center">
				<a 
					href="/#contact" 
					class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-7 py-3.5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-white bg-emerald-900 hover:bg-emerald-950 rounded-full shadow-sm transition-all duration-200"
				>
					Get in Touch
				</a>
			</div>

		</div>
	</main>

	<Footer />
</Layout>
